         -->* Kg (0^11) [] 0 B 0, B = U 10 (U 10 0)   (champion clearing, CDP; 2B+4 = 2 ^11 (2 ^11 4) = 2 ^13 3)
         -->+ Kg (0^(12B-11)) [20;4;21;4] 0 0 6        (REBUILD, quadratic in B)
         -->* Kg (0^(12B-11)) [2;4;21;4] 0 b' 6        (the residue-2 token D20 = "6" cleared, CLR2)
